#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2600"
msgid ""
"Having defeated the Baron and placed his violet orb on the pedestal, you \n"
"step into the portal. Powerful magic sends a tingle over your body, and you are \n"
"transported with a white flash."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2606"
msgid "Click to continue."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2607"
msgid ""
"Through the portal, a weak magic tugs you from the Citadel. Your feet \n"
"hover over the floor as it shakes violently. Pipes and pistons crash down \n"
"in a muffled racket. You have a detached sense of peace, and a moment to \n"
"ponder what has occurred."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2608"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"The lich siblings join the Baron in death, voiding their deals done with \n"
"devils."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2609"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Is it for the best that you escaped death here? Through your trials, you've\n"
"earned power greater than they, their shattered remains proving it."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2610"
msgid ""
"You open your eyes, standing in The Magician's Guild with a wizard and bishop. \n"
"Their faces relax in relief."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2611"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"In the following days, you work with them in secrecy to prevent the realms of\n"
"hell from stepping foot in Hamlet again using the artifacts underground."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2612"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Hamlet begins its ascent toward its former glory. The guilds unite under your \n"
"banner to clear out the straggling monsters and rebuild the city. The citizens \n"
"beg you to take the Baron's court and rule."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2614"
msgid "Power you know will always be waiting."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2633"
msgid "\"Don't worry, brother. There's still a ways to go, they may yet deliver.\""
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2641"
msgid "\"Go about your business, brother. There isn't much to prepare.\""
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2701"
msgid "The %s You are quite the party animal, %s. I couldn't keep up with you!"
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2702"
msgid "The %s Are you sure you got enough rest, %s?"
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2703"
msgid "The %s First you defeat the Baron, and you still out-party a joker like me!"
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2704"
msgid "The %s You're going to take it easy now, though, right %s?"
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2711"
msgid "The %s Everyone came back to their shops, like nothing happened."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2712"
msgid "The %s Hamlet's Shopkeepers are tougher after surviving the Baron's dungeon."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2721"
msgid "The %s How could I ever thank you %s? *hic!*"
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2722"
msgid "The %s I love you, man. Like, seriously, %s, I love you. *hic!*"
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2731"
msgid "%s It's a secret to everybody."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2732"
msgid "%s This used to be the foyer to the Baron's mansion."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2733"
msgid "%s We're remodeling the interior for our next ruler."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2734"
msgid "%s We want to forget all about Herx."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2735"
msgid "%s It's a secret to everybody."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2741"
msgid "The %s I tried to get into the Crystal Caves, but a barrier stopped me."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2742"
msgid "The %s Perhaps the Magician's Guild erected that barrier."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2743"
msgid "The %s I'm from a distant city, and a member of the Hunter's Guild."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2744"
msgid "The %s Hamlet's Hunters' Guild isn't in this district."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2745"
msgid "The %s I guess Magicians and Hunters don't get along so well."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2746"
msgid "The %s Hunters kill bad guys. Sometimes they're Magicians."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2747"
msgid "The %s No grudges, just don't be a bad guy!"
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2751"
msgid "The %s Is it strange that I am tempted to go back into the mine?"
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2752"
msgid "The %s The sky out here is so large. I'm scared."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2753"
msgid "The %s The mines, Herx's dungeon, is on the other side of this gate."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2754"
msgid "The %s Maybe I'll just go back for a little while."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2761"
msgid "The %s The Magician's Guild must be up to something."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2762"
msgid "The %s Guilds always have too many secrets."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2763"
msgid "The %s I heard that Merlin and the Magician's Guild had a falling out."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2764"
msgid "The %s I bet Herx is in tight with Archmagisters Orpheus and Erudyce."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2765"
msgid "The %s Don't get me started on the Hunters' Guild."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2766"
msgid "The %s I heard the Masons Guild works for the Church."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2767"
msgid "The %s The Church has secrets, but they also help the poor."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2768"
msgid "The %s Is the Church a Guild? Asking for a friend."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2771"
msgid "The %s Welcome back, %s. I hope you're rested."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2772"
msgid "The %s The magicians inside can explain everything."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2773"
msgid "The %s Me? No I'm just a doorman."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2774"
msgid "The %s Many come and go, %s. No membership required."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2775"
msgid "The %s Merlin used to come by a lot, but then he just stopped."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2776"
msgid "The %s Come to think of it, Herx used to come by regularly."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2777"
msgid "The %s Herx would always leave angry after every visit."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2778"
msgid "The %s I wish I could've seen Herx's face when you showed up..."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2781"
msgid "The %s The Baron wanted to set up the mine in the Crystal Caves."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2782"
msgid "The %s The Archmagisters refused to allow Herx to mine there."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2783"
msgid "The %s Herx offered a lot of grants to the Magicians' Guild."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2784"
msgid "The %s I think Herx expected favors from the Archmagisters."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2785"
msgid "The %s Eventually Herx gave up on getting the help of the Guild."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2786"
msgid "The %s Things turned out bad, but they could've been worse."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2791"
msgid "The %s Merlin told us about the dangerous magic Herx found."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2792"
msgid "The %s We never heard from Merlin again after he left to stop Herx."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2793"
msgid "The %s I heard rumors about a new letter from Merlin, but I never saw it."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2794"
msgid "The %s You know, Merlin was never an official member of the Magicians Guild."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2795"
msgid "The %s Some people just need their independence. I respect that."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2801"
msgid "The %s After Herx was locked away, the Archmagisters went to the Crystal Caves."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2802"
msgid "The %s I guess they wanted to see what all the fuss was about."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2803"
msgid "The %s If it wasn't for the Archmagisters, Herx would've built an army here."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2804"
msgid "The %s We never would've been able to figure out how to lock Herx away. "
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2805"
msgid "The %s I think Erudyce and Orpheus knew sealing up Herx wouldn't be enough."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2811"
msgid "The %s Powerful monsters started coming from the Crystal Caves."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2812"
msgid "The %s The Guild had to seal the Caves to keep Hamlet from being destroyed."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2813"
msgid "The %s I hope that the Archmagisters inside are alright."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2814"
msgid "The %s I really hope those monsters have nothing to do with their research."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2815"
msgid "The %s Orpheus is so driven. Nothing can stop him."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2816"
msgid "The %s Erudyce likes to influence things from behind the scenes."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2821"
msgid "The %s I sensed power from the orb when you put it on that pedestal."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2822"
msgid "The %s I wonder why Herx didn't use that power to escape the dungeon."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2823"
msgid "The %s I was able to trap some of the power that Herx's orb released."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2824"
msgid "The %s This portal pierces the seal to the Caves using the power of the orb."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2825"
msgid "The %s Archmagisters Orpheus and Erudyce will help return things to normal."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2826"
msgid "The %s They must have learned something about the power Herx found."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2831"
msgid "The %s Don't worry %s, I know who you are."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2832"
msgid "The %s I wanted to meet you before you left town."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2833"
msgid "The %s Me? I am one of the esteemed members of the Merchant's guild."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2834"
msgid ""
"The %s I'm only interested in the rarest of artifacts in the land.\n"
" In particular, the Magician's orbs that were stolen by Herx."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2835"
msgid ""
"The %s If you happened to retrieve any of them, I'd be willing to\n"
" part with one of my prized possessions in return."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2836"
msgid ""
"The %s You see, a high ranking guild member such as myself can extort\n"
" those mages for every penny they own with their precious orbs!"
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2837"
msgid "The %s I know you have too much of a heart to do the same yourself."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2838"
msgid ""
"The %s So it is up to you. Leave them with me and we'll say no more\n"
" about our little encounter."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2907"
msgid "\"Do not be afraid to go slowly, be afraid of stopping.\""
msgstr ""

