#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3771"
msgid ""
"You arrive outside the Hamlet mines and watch the cursed blackness peel away\n"
"from the land. Warm sunlight flows over the countryside. As the doors of the\n"
"mine open wide, people carefully spread into the streets, acclimating to\n"
"their freedom."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3772"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"You rush to nearby buildings, looking for a place to hide and figure out your\n"
"next move. There are too many humans and the sun is too bright for your liking."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3773"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"You break your way into what appears to be an inn. You spend the night under\n"
"the sheets of a comfortable bed while the sounds of revelry surround you."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3774"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Luckily you avoid detection. As humans party through the hostel you hear of\n"
"a power even greater than Herx's, said to be held in the Magician's Guild."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3775"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"A trapdoor in the bunkroom leads to a sewer. You wait for the humans to leave."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3776"
msgid ""
"Hacking your way through every demon in your path, you leap through the\n"
"portal without a moment's hesitation. No entity, mortal or immortal, can\n"
"challenge your power."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3777"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Suddenly, you find yourself standing wearily in an endless white hall dotted\n"
"with enormous pillars that stretch higher than you can see. The smell of\n"
"blood is thick on your breath, but you suspect more will need to be spilled."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3778"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Can this supernatural place compete with Minotaurs, Demons; Baphomet himself?\n"
"You sense a great magic flow into the room. You are unnerved. A voice booms:"
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3779"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\"We have witnessed your strength and lust for power. You were not expected here.\n"
"We are however impressed by your ferocity and focus. We ask you consider this\n"
"proposition, mighty one...\""
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3780"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"As the voice addresses you, you find you are tempted by its words. It speaks\n"
"of a power greater than Herx, or Baphomet. It claims that it is greater than\n"
"you. The prospect of a competitor shall not stand."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3781"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"You find yourself standing inside a Hamlet inn, its denizens too drunk or \n"
"weary to notice you at first. You steal yourself into a backroom; a trapdoor\n"
"leads to a sewer. A great magic from beyond there beckons you."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3782"
msgid ""
"Hacking your way through every demon in your path, you leap through the\n"
"portal without a moment's hesitation. No entity, mortal or immortal, can\n"
"challenge your power."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3783"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Suddenly, you find yourself standing wearily in an endless white hall dotted\n"
"with enormous pillars that stretch higher than you can see. Have you not\n"
"defeated the source of Herx's vile power? You wonder what danger now awaits."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3784"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"A sense of peace overwhelms and refreshes you. You know that Herx's power has\n"
"been removed. But Baphomet was just one devil. A voice comforts you:"
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3785"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\"The lich Herx has become dust, but cleverer foes draw upon hellish evil.\n"
"Hamlet is free for now, but the world is not safe. In times such as these\n"
"a mighty one must tip the scales. We have a proposition for you...\""
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3786"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"As the voice addresses you, you find yourself either unwilling or unable to\n"
"reject what it tells you. You find your physical form shifting back into the\n"
"mortal realm. \"You must sever evil from Hamlet or there will be no peace.\""
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3787"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"With renewed courage, you find yourself standing in Hamlet. Evidence of a\n"
"massive party flows from the gates of the mines, now open, to a nearby hostel.\n"
"You know the Magician's Guild will aid you in your quest."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3788"
msgid ""
"Victorious, you step into the portal. You know not what to expect, but \n"
"are awash with delight. You expect that the source of the Baron's power \n"
"is now within your reach."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3789"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Before you have time to think, you are suddenly standing before the mines \n"
"once more. But something is different; the seductive power you sensed here \n"
"is further away. The black skies are clearing to show the light of day."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3790"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Suddenly, the doors to the mine open wide. Sealed for centuries to contain \n"
"the evil within, they swing out from the inside, as a hundred grateful humans \n"
"rush out. It appears the Baron's power slipped through your grasp."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3791"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"The hellish source of that dark power remains a mystery to you, and some\n"
"eavedropping from the shadows leads you to believe that the Magician's Guild\n"
"may have a lead on some dark magic. For now, you resolve to leave this land\n"
"and return another time to exploit the secrets of Hamlet."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3792"
msgid ""
"Hacking your way through every demon in your path, you leap through the\n"
"portal without a moment's hesitation. It seems no entity, mortal or \n"
"immortal, can challenge your power."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3793"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Suddenly, you find yourself standing wearily in an endless white hall dotted\n"
"with enormous pillars that stretch higher than you can see. The smell of\n"
"blood is thick on your breath, but you suspect more will need to be spilled."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3794"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Can this supernatural place compete with Minotaurs, Demons; Baphomet himself?\n"
"You sense a great magic flow into the room. You are unnerved. A voice booms:"
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3795"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\"We have witnessed your strength and lust for power. You were not expected here.\n"
"We are however impressed by your ferocity and focus. We ask you consider this\n"
"proposition, mighty one...\""
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3796"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"As the voice addresses you, you find yourself either unwilling or unable to\n"
"reject what it tells you. Eventually, there is an inexplicable shift in your\n"
"physical being, and you feel yourself fading away..."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3797"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"You sense the supreme power of a great mind as you fade from the mortal world. \n"
"The first age comes to a close, and the age of chaos begins. You are sure that\n"
"your time is emminent and your purpose will be fulfilled."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3798"
msgid ""
"Through the portal, a weak magic tugs you from the Citadel. Your feet \n"
"hover over the floor as it shakes violently. Pipes and pistons crash down \n"
"in a muffled racket. Your inputs are dulled and you observe the transferrence\n"
"of your consciousness."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3799"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"It seems demonic evil has been destroyed, at least, as far as Hamlet knows."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3800"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"You consider its citizens are lucky to have you. They could not have survived\n"
"without you, but alas, you would never have been invented without them."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3801"
msgid ""
"Your systems are nominal. You stand with a wizard and bishop. Their\n"
"faces open into expressions of surprise."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3802"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"They are shocked to see that a humble slave, a servant... an automaton has\n"
"rescued them from supernatural evil. Is your inhuman nature the reason?"
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3803"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"The guilds and the churches agree, there is no more perfect arbiter for the\n"
"well being of humans. You are entrusted with the tasks of law, assumed to\n"
"have perfect objectivity as the new Baron. Your rulings are infallible."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3804"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"But is that so? What is it that makes you conscious? You lead Hamlet to\n"
"its former glory. But you think some problems may require more power."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3805"
msgid ""
"Through the portal, a weak magic tugs you from the Citadel. Your feet \n"
"hover over the floor as it shakes violently. Pipes and pistons crash down \n"
"in a muffled racket. You clench your eyes knowing magic holds you tight.\n"
"You grimly await what it offers."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3806"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"If the liches gained their powers from devils, what does that make you\n"
"who ended them? Is it now yours to bear? What use was it to them?"
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3807"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"It seems you got what you came here for, though not in the way you\n"
"anticipated. Power cannot just be held, it must be used."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3808"
msgid ""
"You open your eyes and find yourself standing with two mortals. \n"
"They cower in your presence. You command them to bow before you."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3809"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Through demonic magic, you bind their souls hostage in servitude, using\n"
"their influence to bend factions to your secret purpose."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3810"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"The following years are not easy for the surface world. Eventually they learn\n"
"that joy and glory is found in strength. You slaughter all who oppose you.\n"
"Eventually they embrace your nature. The humans bear your banner."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3811"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Can any empire challenge what you've built? Prophets teach that the\n"
"human spirit is stronger than anything. You fear that power is real."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3812"
msgid ""
"Through the portal, a weak magic tugs you from the Citadel. Your feet \n"
"hover over the floor as it shakes violently. Pipes and pistons crash down\n"
"in a muffled racket. You try to shake your terror and close your eyes."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3813"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"What have you to be afraid of? You have defeated mighty, evil masters.\n"
"Who can challenge your people now?"
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3814"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"You fear nothing. No, it is others who should fear you. A moment of clarity\n"
"causes you to wonder if fear is what you want from others."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3815"
msgid ""
"You open your eyes, standing in The Magician's Guild with a wizard and bishop. \n"
"Their faces are confused, but they await your reaction with patient wonder."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3816"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"You suspect things may've gone differently if wiser men had not awaited you.\n"
"They recognized your heroism and offered gratitude for your deeds. Are these\n"
"the same people who murdered your kind so recently?"
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3817"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Though shaky at first, your peoples build an alliance toward peace."
msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3818"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Through your example, insectoids, humans, goatmen and goblins embrace courage\n"
"instead of fear. Trade prospers in Hamlet as people belay their lust for power."
msgstr ""

